  <process id="Id_47ce5fc7-8dfe-44f3-bb94-45c1588b4e7f" name="Processo de Obras Públicas - FNDE/MEC e Municípios - P10. Produção do  Projeto">
    <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Processo de desenvolvimento das adapta&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do projeto padr&amp;atilde;o para as condi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es locais e entrega do projeto considerando a sinergia entre as atividades diversas dos munic&amp;iacute;pios e da Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133/2021 - Lei de Licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e Contratos Administrativos com o Item 5.6- Produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o colaborativa da informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e o Item 5.7 - Entrega do modelo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da ISO 19650-2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
